The KindDefinition JSON files in this directory are protocol surface: they are
the wire shape a second implementation must match, so they are licensed
Apache-2.0 and not under the AGPL that covers the rest of r5e-enterprise. The
prose protocol they belong to is in r5e-core, under the same license.

